The '''Draconic Altar''' is a feature in the {{zone|Void Slate}} that allows players to sacrifice certain items in order to receive [[Essence|Dragon Essence]], [[Dragon Fragment|Dragon Fragments]] and [[Enchanted Ender Pearl|Enchanted Ender Pearls]], and other items.

== Mechanics ==
Certain items can be sacrificed to the '''Draconic Altar''' by right clicking on it with the item in hand. The player will always receive an amount of {{Item|Dragon Essence}}. There is also a {{Green|45%}} chance for bonus items to be rolled, which can be increased by up to {{Green|10%}} with the {{Item|Endermite Pet|rarity=m}}'s {{AN|Sacrificer}} ability.

